<h2 id="current-research-projects">Current research projects</h2>

<ul>
  <li>
    <p>Learning stochastic PDEs in finance using kernel methods.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>Learning/discovery of PDEs using GP/kernel methods with applications in planetary sciences (Jupiter’s radiation belt) and sismic data.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>Scalability of kernel methods for learning systems of PDEs using distributed methods in optimization.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <p>Solving time-dependent PDEs using kernel methods including Fokker-Planck and Keller-Segle models.</p>
  </li>
</ul>

